<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand Budget Policy Statement Table.</title>
<headline>New Zealand Budget Policy Statement Table.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the budget table released by the New Zealand Treasury in the Budget Policy Statement (previous forecasts from the December Economic and Fiscal Update in brackets) in billions of NZ dollars:</p>
<p>		  1997/98	1998/99	1999/00</p>
<p> Net worth   9.3 (9.2)    11.9 (13.6)  15.4 (19.7)</p>
<p> Pct/GDP     9.2 (9.1)    11.3 (12.9)  13.8 (17.7)</p>
<p> Net debt    23.6 (23.8)  22.1 (20.5)  19.8 (15.5)</p>
<p> Pct/GDP     23.4 (23.6)  21.0 (19.4)  17.8 (13.9)</p>
<p> Revenue     36.4 (35.3)  36.7 (36.7)  38.4 (38.4)</p>
<p> Pct/GDP     36.1 (35.0)  34.8 (34.8)  34.5 (34.5)</p>
</text>
